;; LOAD NEGATIVE — a lattice keyword left on (query …).
;;
;; M1e2 S1e2.1a.4 split solving from asking: the keywords that choose the
;; candidate list (`:hrules`, `:hypothesis-relations`, `:no-hypothesis`) are the
;; lattice's, and the lattice is stated once, in `(solve …)`. Several queries
;; ask about one region, so a query may not choose its own. The loader says where
;; the keyword went instead of calling it unknown.
;;
;; Expected (load error): see query_lattice_keyword.expected.

(relation p Thing Place)
(p A H1)
(query :goal (p A ?h) :no-hypothesis (p))
